KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp11
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
Constexpr static member initializers referencing template
metafunctions are not evaluated to compile-time constants.
The template parameter is substituted (Abs<N> → Abs<1>) but
Abs<1>::value is not eagerly instantiated and folded.
Root cause of libc++ std::ratio and std::chrono::duration failures.
